<title>USA: Medical Industries sees higher earnings.</title>
<headline>Medical Industries sees higher earnings.</headline>
<dateline>BOYNTON BEACH, Fla. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Industries of America Inc said on Friday that it expects a substantial increase in both revenue and earnings in the coming 12 months, thanks to the previously announced acquisition of Florida Physicians Internet Inc, a multi-specialty medical practice located in central Florida.</p>
<p>The company predicted $2.4 million in revenue and $1 million in income for the coming 12 months from the acquisition, the company said.</p>
